    {
      "step": "recovery: completion with the derived target",
      "cause": "A completed recovery advances the scope generation, which ends every scoped document (apply_scope, docs/recovery/spec.md §7.6), and the account publishes ScopesWiped { gen } as it does: the event's topic is scopes_wiped and its data the new generation, here 1. It comes after the controller's epoch_advanced and recovery_completed and before the account's credential_revoked and doc_applied; every other event of the step is unchanged and in the same order. No other step completes a recovery, so no other step publishes it, and the corpus applies no scoped document.",
